      "body": "SRF Limited announced that the Board of Directors at its meeting held on 20th January 2026 has declared interim dividend @ 50% i.e. INR 5.00 per share on the paid-up equity share capital of the Company. The interim dividend would be paid to members whose names appear on the register of members and the beneficial owners as per details received from National Securities Depository Limited and Central Depository Services (India) Limited, as on the record date i.e. January 27, 2026. The date of payment of interim dividend will be on or before February 17, 2026.",
